Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-03-03T22:09:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T11:27:10Z","closed_at":"2025-03-05T18:08:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103526.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-05T18:08:45Z"},"body":"Persistent window state doesn't work if your window is 'tiled' in X11 gnome (snapped/docked left or right)\r\n\r\n3.x checks for `horz && vert`\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4396e98834f159da59ec790f2ff64fb65dacd9ce/platform/x11/os_x11.cpp#L1708\r\n\r\n4.x also checked `horz && vert` until this change where it was switched to `horz || vert`\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/524f061c015b8070de73381bf6b7932514de79de#diff-05f85bc3bf96d384f6b96260c758e63e10bbdd52b04f8ccb34649372e7bc1f48R1382\r\n\r\nThe corrected logic is:\r\nCheck `horz && vert` for 'is_maximized'\r\nCheck `horz || vert` for 'can_maximize'\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","